    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d304">

                <pb facs="0352" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg302"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr.
                            Young.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 107.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge receipt of Mr.
                    Pringle’s No. 88, of the 24th ultimo, in relation to the autograph letter from
                    the Provisional President of Honduras to the President of the United States,
                    which was transmitted with his No. 85, of the 10th ultimo.</p>
                <p>Mr. Pringle did right to forward a communication so received from the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> head of the Government with which
                    intercourse is held.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
